            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1042",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah… okay.",
                "zh": "啊，好。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2124.0,
            "positionY": 122.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "81c85975-01ce-4794-9d6b-2fb1b6e1b230",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1043",
            "content": {
                "en": "Mm. I hope you’ll like it. Just come find me afterward. I’ll deal with these matters as quickly as I can—",
                "zh": "嗯。希望你会喜欢。之后来这里找就好，我会尽快把事务处理——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2459.33349609375,
            "positionY": 127.33332824707031,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c767ce01-b3a4-49b9-9028-3c5cc3ebe217",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "f469ee47-53a3-4da4-b089-6a4e306e38cd",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1044",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sect Leader, there’s also the staffing change issue…",
                "zh": "家主大人，还有人员的变动问题......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2792.0,
            "positionY": 129.3333282470703,
